[[The Battle Cats Unite!]] has three distinct versions (International, Japanese, and Southeast Asia), each of which may receive independent updates that introduce different content. Consequently, the same patch number can refer to entirely different updates across versions, with one version potentially receiving content years after another version has already passed that patch.

==Subpages==
